# Call the Spirit Dragons: "If you put +1/+1 counters on five Dragons this way" - only counters that were actually put count. Bot1
# has all five single-color Dragons by T11 (see the win scenario), but casts Solemnity ("Counters can't be put on ... creatures") that
# turn too, a noncreature spell, which also makes Traxos, Academy Guardian cost {2} less. At the T13 upkeep every color still finds
# its Dragon and nothing is put on any of them: Traxos stays 1/5, the Flock Impostor keeps the four counters it already had (6/6) and
# nobody wins.

